        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "da675a76-b0f0-3505-8611-c1c3db34720a",
                "word": "animadversion",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c6de2b94-e402-4027-86cd-1c477dc76381",
                        "entry_id": "da675a76-b0f0-3505-8611-c1c3db34720a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "animadversions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c36ae64-ad57-3b50-8a0a-34cc13f704c4",
                        "entry_id": "da675a76-b0f0-3505-8611-c1c3db34720a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Censure, blâme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32bfe139-ad9d-4ec7-ad34-ffe7ac6eba5a",
                                "sense_id": "0c36ae64-ad57-3b50-8a0a-34cc13f704c4",
                                "text": "Ce procédé mérite l’animadversion publique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29f09bd0-4b1c-4104-89dc-13c4c9759c1d",
                                "sense_id": "0c36ae64-ad57-3b50-8a0a-34cc13f704c4",
                                "text": "Cet écrit lui a attiré l’animadversion de toutes les honnêtes gens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a2c2745-5218-4648-a473-9117c8ed08a9",
                                "sense_id": "0c36ae64-ad57-3b50-8a0a-34cc13f704c4",
                                "text": "Encourir l’animadversion d’une personne, d’une famille."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad9832b7-44f3-31c4-8ba6-7018883d41e6",
                        "entry_id": "da675a76-b0f0-3505-8611-c1c3db34720a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Haine persévérante, antipathie agressive."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c7d8247-eaf3-41b4-9aee-8f998d5fea82",
                                "sense_id": "ad9832b7-44f3-31c4-8ba6-7018883d41e6",
                                "text": "Depuis quatre ans, les Reybert, excommuniés par la belle régisseuse, se voyaient en butte à tant d’animadversion de la part des adhérents des Moreau, que leur position dans le pays n’eût pas été tenable sans la pensée de vengeance qui les avait soutenus jusqu’à ce jour."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8c87fce-93ae-45d5-b19b-d3e102518a73",
                                "sense_id": "ad9832b7-44f3-31c4-8ba6-7018883d41e6",
                                "text": "L’animadversion des classes inférieures contre la classe aristocratique ne détruit pas son ascendant sur ceux mêmes dont elle est haïe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d1a8e33-e5d9-4307-a0d5-5f687f4cb7d5",
                                "sense_id": "ad9832b7-44f3-31c4-8ba6-7018883d41e6",
                                "text": "En sorte que si le gouvernement avait moins à redouter l’animadversion de ses administrés, il est certain que le plus grand nombre de ces fonctionnaires, désormais inutiles, seraient forcés de consacrer leur activité et leurs talents spéciaux à des entreprises plus profitables et moins stériles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed6404a6-6c31-4815-8951-bd566fa1e21a",
                                "sense_id": "ad9832b7-44f3-31c4-8ba6-7018883d41e6",
                                "text": "Or, ne nous arrêtons pas à l’animadversion et à la hargne contenues dans ces lettres furibondes, prenons plutôt la mesure des idées."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4ae574a-6e8a-4065-b783-df870bc02ccd",
                                "sense_id": "ad9832b7-44f3-31c4-8ba6-7018883d41e6",
                                "text": "Je vous prie de ne pas me tutoyer, coupable, répondit le maire d’un ton digne. Sachez que c’est moi qui vous fais arrêter… dans votre intérêt… pour la cause publique… car vos procédés indignes à l’égard de messieurs les ingénieurs ont soulevé l’animadversion générale contre votre personne en particulier…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d393698-8200-4563-9504-8cfeb6c98b85",
                        "source_entry_id": "da675a76-b0f0-3505-8611-c1c3db34720a",
                        "target_lang_word": "animadversion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "animadversion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "410250e2-0cab-3681-a7a5-d3d2116e5313",
                                        "entry_id": "a4f3250c-b7f5-3170-ae4a-bd93a2b1056d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A criticism, a critical remark."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "120b3fb4-e2bc-4804-b494-9584b524b0b8",
                                                "sense_id": "410250e2-0cab-3681-a7a5-d3d2116e5313",
                                                "text": "[A] misconstruction or misinterpretation, nay, the misplacing of a comma, was in Gifford's eyes a crime worthy of the most severe animadversion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a90c68a-6e89-49f8-bf59-e4815bc77bcd",
                                                "sense_id": "410250e2-0cab-3681-a7a5-d3d2116e5313",
                                                "text": "While the censorious man is most severe in judging others, he is invariably the most ready to repel any animadversions made upon himself; upon the principle well understood in medical circles, that the feeblest bodies are always the most sensitive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6d23bc9-571c-4b93-8fff-9a32af88fbab",
                                                "sense_id": "410250e2-0cab-3681-a7a5-d3d2116e5313",
                                                "text": "There is no need for us to be indignant. On the contrary we can now see that these animadversions of the Christian writers are the evidence of how and to what extent in the spread of Christianity over the world it had become fused with the Pagan cults previously existing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc961443-6d74-3077-92c1-d7850c698e07",
                                        "entry_id": "a4f3250c-b7f5-3170-ae4a-bd93a2b1056d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or characteristic of being animadversive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a91280f-0fb4-4f3e-a5bc-8fb84dcfc805",
                                                "sense_id": "dc961443-6d74-3077-92c1-d7850c698e07",
                                                "text": "He was deceived; for justice hath also knowledge and animadversion over such as gather stubble (as the common saying is) or looke about for grape-seed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fd4f4fe-9583-4396-97d1-996f6fbe1614",
                                                "sense_id": "dc961443-6d74-3077-92c1-d7850c698e07",
                                                "text": "Nor have I scrupled, in so flagrant a case, to allow myself a severity of animadversion little congenial with the general spirit of these papers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbc85027-f69d-4f3a-923c-28d394046de2",
                                                "sense_id": "dc961443-6d74-3077-92c1-d7850c698e07",
                                                "text": "In a government like ours more especially should all public acts be, as far as practicable, simple, undisguised, and intelligible, that they may become fit subjects for the approbation to animadversion of the people."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "793cc88e-039e-4b4b-8773-180a19d69760",
                        "source_entry_id": "da675a76-b0f0-3505-8611-c1c3db34720a",
